---
import Info from '../components/Info.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mainImage from '../images/beryl reese smoke gaypossum ane.jpg';
import plural from '../images/plural.gif';
import system from '../images/system.gif';
import nonverbal from '../images/nonverbal.gif';
---
<Info title="Beryl's System">
    <Fragment slot="image">
        <Image class="main" src={mainImage} alt="From Left to Right, Smoke the Pine Marten, Beryl the Bunny, and Reese the Rat" style="weight:300px;height:auto;"/>
        <div class="credit">Art by <a class="external" href="https://thegaypossum.carrd.co/">The Gay Possum</a></div>
    </Fragment>
    <Fragment slot="blinkies">
        <Image class="blinky" src={plural} alt="PLURAL AND PROUD"/>
        <Image class="blinky" src={system} alt="WE'RE A SYSTEM"/>
        <Image class="blinky" src={nonverbal} alt="I'm non-verbal right now"/>
    </Fragment>
    <p>
        I am a <strong>PLURAL SYSTEM</strong>, with three identified members.
        <strong>MEMORIES</strong> are not shared between members, but <strong>CO-FRONTING</strong> as well as <strong>CHILLING IN THE BACKGROUND</strong> are both common in our system.
    </p>
    <p>
        <strong>RUG</strong> is one of the more visible members, often represented by a <strong>BLUE BUNNY</strong>.
        They lean <strong>FEMME</strong>, and feel <strong>romantic attraction</strong> strongly.
        It is quite bubbly, and one of the main signs it is <strong>FRONTING</strong> is that it's <strong>VOICE</strong> is <strong>HIGHER</strong> than the rest of the system.
        Their <strong>THERIOTYPE</strong> is mainly <strong>AMERICAN BLUE RABBIT</strong>, but they feel some <strong>FISHER</strong> feelings due to <strong>ASSIMILATING</strong> with <strong>FLAX</strong> previously.
        Its sona is <strong>REESE</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
        <strong>FLAX</strong> is the other more visible member, often represented by a tan <strong>FISHER</strong>.
        They are much more <strong>AGENDER</strong> than <strong>RUG</strong>, and they are the most <strong>ASEXUAL</strong> and <strong>AROMANTIC</strong> member of the system.
        They are reserved in temperment, and its <strong>VOICE</strong> when fronting is <strong>FLAT IN TONE</strong>. 
        Their <strong>THERIOTYPE</strong> is mainly <strong>FISHER</strong>, but they feel some <strong>BUNNY</strong> feelings due to <strong>ASSIMILATING</strong> with <strong>RUG</strong> previously. 
        They are the <strong>PROTECTOR</strong> of the system.
    </p>
    <p>
        <strong>THE THIRD THING</strong>, or <strong>3</strong>, is the newest identified member of the system, however we believe it and <strong>FLAX</strong> split apart back in highschool.
        It is completely <strong>NONVERBAL</strong>, and generally only fronts when it feels <strong>SAFE</strong>, or the other two are <strong>SLEEPING</strong>. 
        <strong>3</strong> normally hangs out in the background when <strong>FLAX</strong> or <strong>RUG</strong> are fronting, and may cause our body to <strong>SHIVER</strong> sometimes for various reasons.
        It is very timid, and is completely <strong>FISHER</strong>. 
        Its sona is <strong>SMOKE</strong>.
    </p>
</Info>
